            "end": 62
          }
        },
        {
          "exampleId": "w:vision#e-e7f6d29fb3e7aa37",
          "text": "At the heart of her vision is the idea that urban life should be an energetic and rich affair, whereby people are able to interact with one another in dense (稠密) and exciting urban environments.",
